### 책 목록
GET http://localhost:4000/api/books

### 책 올리기
# @name created
POST http://localhost:4000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "코드 그 자체",
  "author": "박서준",
  "stock": 999
}

### 제목 없이 올리기
POST http://localhost:4000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "박서준"
}

### 방금 올린 책의 재고를 9로
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/books/{{created._id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 9
}

### 방금 올린 책 지우기
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/books/{{created._id}}
